    "closed": [
      "Optional trusted shared-restore guard runs at replay, after drain, after safety-copy fsync/before files, and inside the one I01 transaction before replacement SQL",
      "Final guard reads original live legacy/SQL rather than the replacement snapshot; read methods expire and SQLite readonly flag prevents UPDATE RETURNING through get/all",
      "Async/thenable guards rejected; late rejection consumed; role loss at each boundary rolls back files without resurrecting an old Admin",
      "Whole legacy/canonical table fingerprint retains financial/write nonce receipts, signed64 money strings and unrelated Tasks; only strict snapshot-read markers and SQL/key order are ignored",
      "Full-media and public-setting fingerprint fences before promotion; local private provider settings remain preserved by the existing engine",
      "Preparation requires current Admin, trusted inactive receipt schema, persisted/read-back full private backup and source consistency; ordinary credential-excluded backup is refused",
      "Apply binds backup/run/source/files/at/target and validated replacement digests to original request context; unrelated changes, swapped backups and mismatched request owners refuse before mutation",
      "Same Admin/nonce/intent returns original compact acknowledgement after lost commit reply or later cutover; current deletion/demotion still blocks replay; no repeat backup/restore/financial body",
      "Original I01 lease assertion survives the async command context; expired lease, SQL obstruction and concurrent Task/role changes roll back media/data/cache with identical retry",
      "New no-op attempts do not restore the whole app; pending remote media stays explicit, valid replacements resolve it without fetch, activation stays off",
      "Three fresh isolated imports open no store or files; real native service scenarios preserve financial rows and original legacy receipts"
    ],
    "remaining": [
      "Production host binding to protected/encrypted persisted private backup storage, real lifecycle maintenance and reviewed Admin prepare/confirm UI/operator; no route/automatic activation added",
      "Financial quarantine remediation, raw legacy JSON ZIP conversion, canonical legacy write bridge/cutover and retention",
      "Preferences and remaining Wallet/M1/I02/I03/master feature/acceptance work",
      "Final independent whole-branch review and exact-HEAD Windows2022/Node22/other browsers/native touch/package/service; actual Server2019R02 separate"
    ],
